<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Western Wireless started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Western Wireless started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it initiated coverage of Western Wireless Corp with an accumulate rating with a $21 12-month price target.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 to 14.</p>
</text>
